            "type": "diagram",
            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"55\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PICK YOUR TEST</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"23\">Four honest questions</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"170\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"225\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">1. Am I average risk?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"300\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"355\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">2. What will I really do?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"430\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">3. What schedule can I keep?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"560\" width=\"800\" height=\"90\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"200\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">4. What does my plan cover?</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"700\" width=\"800\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"760\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Positive stool test? Colonoscopy within weeks</text></svg>",
            "caption": "A four-question guide to choosing a colorectal screening test"
